{#-
Last updated by Dylan 5/01/2026. Adding conditional to restrict downloads to NYPR staff or administrators and removing downloads column for non-approved users
Last updated by Diego 4/30/2026. Adds Holdings & dynamic Audio Player via blocks. See https://archives.nypublicradio.org/metadatadisplay/33
Previously updated by Diego 4/14/2026. Uses Metadata and Admin info from blocks. Here they are not loaded via AJAX, but rendered inline
Previously updated by Diego 4/01/2026. Avoid accordeons if Descriptions are short + add new SVG in red for them
Previously updated by Diego 3/31/2026. WIP to match Mockup.
Previously updated by Allison 3/23 & 3/24 2026. Updates for many fields based on actual ingested data.
Additional elements added per shared Metadata Fields document notations.
More updates still needed, and will be continuous throughout end of March into April 2026.

Previously updated based on the general Object Description to be a better Show Display 01/20/2026
Previously updated 23/10/2025 to add optional rich text support to html_output for Drupal
- Detects "value" property automatically (Drupal text fields)
- When rich = true, outputs HTML safely using |raw (Drupal already sanitizes)
Updated 15/02/2024 to add |striptags to html_output macro
Previously updated 31/10/2023 for 1.3.0
- switched to Macro approach; added Nav-tabs for main description display and downloads menu.
- MACROS:
  - uses two macros originally created by Diego,
  - uses two macros originally created by Allison for internal-search referenced elements
- File downloads nav-tab
